@host = http://localhost:5084

# Local tokens (see README → Authentication). Create them once with:
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project Ticketing.Api --name organizer@example.com --role Organizer --output token
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project Ticketing.Api --name customer@example.com --role Customer --output token
@organizerToken = <paste organizer token>
@customerToken = <paste customer token>

### Create a draft event (Organizer)
# @name createEvent
POST {{host}}/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rust Belt Jazz Night",
  "description": "An evening of live jazz.",
  "venue": "The Grand Hall",
  "startsAt": "2027-06-01T19:30:00-04:00",
  "capacity": 150
}

### Publish it (Organizer, owner only)
POST {{host}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Reserve two seats, held for 10 minutes (Customer)
# @name reserve
POST {{host}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerEmail": "fan@example.com",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Confirm the reservation (Customer who made it)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reserve.response.body.$.id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Check the reservation (its customer or the event's organizer)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reserve.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Seats available should now be 148 (public)
GET {{host}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}

### Upcoming published events (public)
GET {{host}}/api/events?status=Published&page=1&pageSize=20

### Cancel the reservation, releasing its seats (customer or organizer)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/{{reserve.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Cancel the event (Organizer, owner only)
POST {{host}}/api/events/{{createEvent.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Health (public)
GET {{host}}/health
